{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 89, :comments ["<b>And when Moses would come.</b> Since the verse speaks of the dedication of the altar, we learn here that the Shekhinah dwells upon him, and from there the voice goes forth. Some interpret that the beginning of the book of Leviticus — to Moses — was when the dedication was completed. <b>The order of the portion of Naso is complete.</b>"], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:53.096592525Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}